elease_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":3,"section_title":"Signed densities and pointwise stabilizers","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:64f75e034a81e67bf269b549d20f2fbdd3f128ca04d27253e132e62ebd547d37","file":"preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/02-static.tex","line":128,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"6bc30bc80c08e4936bd45ed381614a7e36a225ba94ebe5549577e37ed3f69e99","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/02-static.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:64f75e034a81e67bf269b549d20f2fbdd3f128ca04d27253e132e62ebd547d37","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/02-static.tex#L128"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:one-sided-type-angle}\nLet $W$ be any set of $p=sm-l$ occupied cells of an $s$-row,\n$m$-column rectangle. On $V^{\\otimes W}$, let $P$ be the global\n$G_q$-type projection with type $(\\alpha,\\beta)$, and let $P_H$ and\n$P_K$ be products of prescribed column and row $G_q$-type projections.\nWrite $(a^j,b^j)$ for the column types and $(c^i,d^i)$ for the row\ntypes, with sizes equal to their respective occupied block sizes.\nPut\n\\[\n \\begin{gathered}\n F=F(\\alpha,\\beta),\\qquad F_H=\\sum_jF(a^j,b^j),\\qquad\n F_K=\\sum_iF(c^i,d^i),\\\\\n U_H=\\prod_ju(a^j,b^j),\\qquad U_K=\\prod_iu(c^i,d^i).\n \\end{gathered}\n\\]\nIf $b_i$ cells are missing from row $i$, put\n\\[\n \\Phi_K(W)=\\prod_{i:b_i<m}\n       \\left(\\frac m{m-b_i}\\right)^{m-b_i},\n\\]\nusing factor one when a row is empty. Then\n\\begin{equation}\n \\|P_H P_KP\\|_{\\rm op}^2\n \\le\\min\\{1,e^{F_H+F_K-F}U_HU_K\\Phi_K(W)\\}\n \\le\\min\\{1,e^{F_H+F_K-F+l}U_HU_K\\}.\n \\label{eq:one-sided-type-angle-exact}\n\\end{equation}\nIn particular $U_HU_K\\le(p+1)^{(s+m)q(q-1)}$."}
